INSERT INTO `chat_messages` VALUES (1,1,'user','hi','2026-06-23 05:55:06.727947'),(2,2,'user','hi','2026-06-23 05:56:23.961136'),(3,3,'user','hi','2026-06-23 06:19:15.176785'),(4,4,'user','i have tooth pain','2026-06-23 06:20:15.003257'),(5,5,'user','I have back pain..','2026-06-23 06:26:24.765618'),(6,5,'assistant','Got it. Is this something that came on suddenly, or has it been building over time?','2026-06-23 06:26:25.802379'),(7,5,'user','last 2 months i have this','2026-06-23 06:26:57.295304'),(8,5,'assistant','Thanks for sharing all of that. I\'ll find the best Orthopedic Surgeon options near you.','2026-06-23 06:26:57.813668'),(9,6,'user','Tooth pain','2026-06-23 06:27:54.134204'),(10,6,'assistant','Sorry to hear that — tooth pain is no fun. How long has it been bothering you, and would you say it\'s a dull ache or sharp pain?','2026-06-23 06:27:54.638985'),(11,6,'user','Suddenly yestrerday','2026-06-23 06:28:19.906333'),(12,6,'assistant','Thanks for sharing all of that. I\'ll find the best General Dentist options near you.','2026-06-23 06:28:20.656094'),(13,7,'user','my daughter have cold','2026-06-23 07:22:36.164127'),(14,7,'assistant','Thanks for sharing. Can you tell me a bit more — how long has this been going on, and is it getting worse?','2026-06-23 07:22:37.304239'),(15,8,'user','My daughter have suffering from cold for past 10 days','2026-06-23 07:23:16.851488'),(16,8,'assistant','Thanks for sharing. Can you tell me a bit more — how long has this been going on, and is it getting worse?','2026-06-23 07:23:17.697137'),(17,9,'user','Tooth pain','2026-06-23 07:26:20.601418'),(18,10,'user','my daughter have a tooth pain from yesterday','2026-06-23 07:31:06.652429'),(19,10,'assistant','Sorry to hear that — tooth pain is no fun. How long has it been bothering you, and would you say it\'s a dull ache or sharp pain?','2026-06-23 07:31:07.358005'),(20,10,'user','yy','2026-06-23 07:31:52.143042'),(21,11,'user','I have tooth pain from last 2 days','2026-06-23 07:33:22.796086'),(22,11,'assistant','I\'m sorry you\'re dealing with tooth pain — that can be really uncomfortable. \n\nTo help me match you with the right dentist, let me ask: **Is the pain constant, or does it come and go? And does anything make it better or worse** (like hot/cold foods, chewing, or pressure)?','2026-06-23 07:33:30.159070'),(23,11,'user','No it suddenly start from yesterday , I dont have tooth issues before','2026-06-23 07:34:37.342618'),(24,11,'assistant','Got it — so this came on suddenly without any previous dental problems. That\'s helpful to know.\n\n**When you feel the pain, can you point to roughly where it is in your mouth?** For example, is it a specific tooth, your whole jaw, or somewhere else?','2026-06-23 07:34:39.180525'),(25,11,'user','Yest it is fir specific tooth','2026-06-23 07:35:04.469418'),(26,11,'assistant','Thank you — that\'s important information.\n\n**On a scale of 1-10, how severe is the pain right now?** And does anything seem to trigger it or make it feel worse?','2026-06-23 07:35:06.720919'),(27,12,'user','I need a dentist','2026-06-23 08:04:25.686998'),(28,12,'assistant','I\'d be happy to help you find the right dentist! \n\nWhat\'s bringing you in today — is this about a tooth that\'s bothering you, a routine cleaning, something cosmetic, or something else?','2026-06-23 08:04:27.655074'),(29,12,'user','just a cleaning and irregular teeth','2026-06-23 08:04:55.122025'),(30,12,'assistant','Got it — so you\'re looking for preventive care and also thinking about straightening your teeth.\n\nAre you more interested in addressing the cleaning first, or are you ready to explore options for both at the same time?','2026-06-23 08:04:56.806015'),(31,12,'user','hh','2026-06-23 08:05:02.893420'),(32,12,'assistant','No problem! Let me ask this another way — are you looking to start with a cleaning soon, or are you more interested in exploring teeth straightening first?','2026-06-23 08:05:05.205010'),(33,13,'user','Annual checkup','2026-06-23 08:10:19.676950'),(34,13,'assistant','Got it — sounds like you\'re due for a routine checkup. \n\n**Quick question:** Is this your first time getting a checkup in a while, or do you see a doctor regularly? And do you have any specific health concerns you\'re hoping to address during the visit, or is it mainly preventive?','2026-06-23 08:10:24.317819'),(35,13,'user','tt','2026-06-23 08:10:29.900711'),(36,13,'assistant','I\'m not sure what you meant by \"tt\" — could you clarify? Are you saying yes, you see a doctor regularly, or did that get sent by accident?','2026-06-23 08:10:35.453311'),(37,13,'user','ff','2026-06-23 08:10:41.174258'),(38,13,'assistant','No problem — let me ask more clearly:\n\n**Do you currently have a primary care doctor, or are you looking to establish care with someone new?**','2026-06-23 08:10:45.763120'),(39,14,'user','I have a back pain for last 3 days can you find a doctor in india ?','2026-06-23 08:34:06.460398'),(40,14,'assistant','I\'m sorry to hear about your back pain. I\'d like to understand your situation better so I can point you to the right doctor.\n\n**How would you describe the pain — is it sharp and sudden, or more of a dull ache that\'s been building up?**','2026-06-23 08:34:11.600717'),(41,14,'user','It is sharp pain..','2026-06-23 08:34:38.807947'),(42,14,'assistant','That helps, thank you. Sharp pain needs attention.\n\n**Did something specific trigger it — like a fall, heavy lifting, or an awkward movement — or did it start without an obvious cause?**','2026-06-23 08:34:40.440628'),(43,14,'user','I am an IT employ sitting long time..','2026-06-23 08:35:09.707347'),(44,14,'assistant','That makes sense — prolonged sitting can definitely cause sharp back pain. \n\n**On a scale of 1-10, how severe is the pain right now, and does it feel better or worse when you move or change positions?**','2026-06-23 08:35:10.957291'),(45,15,'user','yy','2026-06-23 08:38:40.946500'),(46,15,'assistant','Hi there! ? I\'m here to help you find the right doctor for your needs.\n\nWhat\'s going on that brought you in today?','2026-06-23 08:38:42.430584'),(47,15,'user','yy','2026-06-23 08:38:44.994562'),(48,15,'assistant','I\'m not sure I caught that — could you tell me a bit more about what\'s bothering you or what you\'d like help with?','2026-06-23 08:38:46.516340'),(49,15,'user','yy','2026-06-23 08:38:49.420220'),(50,15,'assistant','I want to make sure I understand — are you having a health concern you\'d like help finding a doctor for? Feel free to describe what\'s going on whenever you\'re ready.','2026-06-23 08:38:50.922252'),(51,16,'user','ee','2026-06-23 08:39:26.233972'),(52,16,'assistant','Hi there! ? I\'m here to help you find the right doctor.\n\nWhat\'s bringing you in today? Tell me what\'s going on.','2026-06-23 08:39:27.537630'),(53,16,'user','ee','2026-06-23 08:39:30.541518'),(54,16,'assistant','I\'m here to help! Could you describe what you\'re experiencing or what brought you in today? Even a brief description helps me point you in the right direction.','2026-06-23 08:39:31.778291'),(55,16,'user','ee','2026-06-23 08:39:35.417459'),(56,16,'assistant','I want to make sure I understand — are you having a health issue you\'d like help with, or did you reach out by accident?\n\nJust let me know what\'s going on, and I\'ll help match you with the right doctor. ?','2026-06-23 08:39:36.780978'),(57,17,'user','I need a dentist','2026-06-23 08:41:36.527225'),(58,17,'assistant','I\'d be happy to help you find the right dentist! \n\nWhat\'s bringing you in today — are you looking for a regular checkup, or is there something specific going on with your teeth or gums?','2026-06-23 08:41:37.988728'),(59,17,'user','dfdf','2026-06-23 08:41:40.649922'),(60,17,'assistant','I\'m not sure I caught that — could you tell me a bit more about what\'s going on with your teeth or mouth?','2026-06-23 08:41:41.826448'),(61,17,'user','dfdf','2026-06-23 08:41:44.061496'),(62,17,'assistant','No problem — let me ask differently. Are you experiencing any pain, or is this more about a routine cleaning or checkup?','2026-06-23 08:41:45.236134'),(63,18,'user','I need a dentist','2026-06-23 08:44:34.661713'),(64,18,'assistant','I\'d be happy to help you find the right dentist! To point you in the best direction, could you tell me what\'s bringing you in today — are you looking for a routine cleaning, dealing with tooth pain, or something else?','2026-06-23 08:44:37.216576'),(65,18,'user','ddd','2026-06-23 08:44:43.323758'),(66,18,'assistant','I want to make sure I understand — could you tell me a bit more about what you need help with? Are you experiencing tooth pain, looking for a regular checkup, or something different?','2026-06-23 08:44:44.560744'),(67,18,'user','ddd','2026-06-23 08:44:46.640575'),(68,18,'assistant','I\'m here to help! When you\'re ready, just let me know what\'s going on with your teeth or mouth — whether it\'s pain, a cleaning, or something else — and I\'ll match you with the right dentist.','2026-06-23 08:44:49.502789'),(69,18,'user','dd','2026-06-23 08:44:53.767422'),(70,19,'user','I need a dentist','2026-06-23 09:53:58.669155'),(71,19,'assistant','I\'d be happy to help you find the right dentist! \n\nTo point you in the right direction, what\'s bringing you in today — is it a dental pain, a routine cleaning, something about how your teeth look, or something else?','2026-06-23 09:54:00.281721'),(72,19,'user','hi','2026-06-23 09:54:05.218934'),(73,19,'assistant','Hey there! No problem — let me ask you this:\n\nAre you dealing with a **toothache or pain**, or is this more about a **routine check-up or cleaning**?','2026-06-23 09:54:06.629584'),(74,19,'user','dfdf','2026-06-23 09:54:09.262998'),(75,19,'assistant','I\'m here to help when you\'re ready! \n\nTake your time — what\'s going on with your teeth or mouth that made you reach out today?','2026-06-23 09:54:10.803190'),(76,20,'user','Tooth pain','2026-06-23 09:55:19.456545'),(77,20,'assistant','I\'