eaks a language other than English?','2026-08-26 03:20:02.290292'),(1773,128,'user','No','2026-08-26 03:20:04.265944'),(1774,128,'assistant','Thanks!\n\nOn a scale of 1–5, how much does the doctor\'s personality and bedside manner matter to you vs. just their credentials?','2026-08-26 03:20:04.279383'),(1775,128,'user','5','2026-08-26 03:20:05.960702'),(1776,128,'assistant','Thanks!\n\nDo you value a doctor who takes a holistic or integrative approach, or do you prefer strictly conventional medicine?','2026-08-26 03:20:07.113821'),(1777,128,'user','doesn\'t matter','2026-08-26 03:20:08.525391'),(1778,128,'assistant','Thanks!\n\nIs there anything else that matters to you when finding your perfect doctor that we haven\'t asked yet?','2026-08-26 03:20:09.753417'),(1779,128,'user','No','2026-08-26 03:20:13.603896'),(1780,128,'assistant','Please wait for a while — I\'m searching for the best matches for you.','2026-08-26 03:20:13.642404'),(1781,128,'assistant','Above is the list of doctors I found that match your requirements. I think they could be a great fit. Here\'s who I found—and why I think each one could be the right choice.\n\nWould you like me to call their offices to book an appointment?','2026-08-26 03:20:44.887720');
