INSERT INTO `home_page_content` VALUES (1,'Find top dental implant specialists in Houston. NuviDoc matches you with the best local implant dentists — free for patients.','HOUSTON DENTISTS · EMERGENCY · SAME-DAY · NEAR YOU','Find a Houston implant dentist<br>you can <em>trust.</em>','Tell Nuvi what\'s going on - missing teeth, implant questions, or a failing tooth. We\'ll connect you with the right Houston implant dentist','WHY NUVIDOC','Finding a Houston dentist shouldn\'t feel like<br><em>searching in the dark.</em>','NO MORE GUESSING','We do the work.<br><em>You just show up.</em>','START NOW — IT\'S FREE','The best dentist in Houston is<br><em>closer than you think.</em>','Emergency, same-day, or routine care — tell us what\'s going on. We\'ll match you with a Houston dentist. Always free for patients.','Find a Houston Dentist →','2026-08-19 11:28:55','3 min','Average time to match','Houston','Dentists across the Baytown–Katy corridor','Same-day','Urgent & emergency dental options','$0','Always free for patients','WORKS WITH MAJOR DENTAL INSURANCE PLANS IN HOUSTON','Matched, not just listed','NuviDoc understands your situation — emergency pain, same-day care, implants, or a new dental home — and finds the Houston dentist who\'s actually right for you.','Same-day & near you','Need a dentist near me today? See real availability and request a visit without calling three offices.','Reviews you can trust','Reviews from verified patients who actually visited. We track what matters: did they listen, were they on time, would patients go back.','COMMON VISIT REASONS','<h2 class=\"section-h2\" id=\"implant-types-heading\" style=\"color: rgb(26, 43, 34); background-color: rgb(245, 247, 246);\">Which implant solution is right for you?</h2>','HOUSTON DENTAL CARE','Dentists.<br><em>One place.</em>','We\'re focused on Houston dentistry first. Tell Nuvi what you need — emergency relief, same-day treatment, general care, ortho, or implants — and we\'ll match you.','TOP HOUSTON DENTISTS','Real dentists.<br><em>Real results.</em>','Highly rated Houston-area providers — tap a card to view profile, call the office, and read reviews.','Tell us what\'s wrong','Describe what\'s going on in your own words — “my molar hurts when I bite” or “I need a same-day dentist” works perfectly.','We find your best Houston match','A few quick follow-ups — urgency, ZIP, preferences — then we rank Houston dentists by fit. Not by who paid the most.','Call or book — we handle the rest','Call the office directly or request a visit online. The practice confirms, and you\'re on the calendar.','Free for patients · Houston-first · No account required to start');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `home_page_content` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

