aven\'t asked yet?','Yes or no',13,1,'2026-06-29 08:34:14.278730',5,'Variable'),(14,'Would you feel more comfortable with a doctor who shares some of your personal interests or lifestyle?','Yes or no',14,0,'2026-06-29 08:34:14.278760',5,NULL),(15,'Do you have a preference for your doctor\'s approximate age group?','30s, 40s–50s, 60s+, or no preference',15,0,'2026-06-29 08:34:14.278792',5,NULL),(16,'Is there anything else that matters to you when finding your perfect doctor that we haven\'t asked yet?','Required — share any preference, or say \'nothing else\' if you\'re all set',16,0,'2026-06-29 08:34:14.278820',5,NULL);
